 "utterances": [
  {
   "start": 5.81,
   "end": 9.31,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Morning, everyone. Tuesday the third. Can you all hear me?"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.47,
   "end": 12.57,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Yeah, but someone's coming through twice."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.04,
   "end": 18.54,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "That'll be me. Laptop and headset both having a go."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.48,
   "end": 22.58,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "One of you's quite enough, thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.93,
   "end": 24.68,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "There. Constructive feedback as ever."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.5,
   "end": 27.7,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Lovely. Everyone in?"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.09,
   "end": 32.29,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "I'm here, just not on camera. Teams has picked the ceiling again."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.95,
   "end": 35.05,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Very clean ceiling, to be fair."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.66,
   "end": 41.26,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Before we start properly, that charity bake sale on Friday — apparently bought cakes are cheating."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.94,
   "end": 44.39,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Only if you leave the sticker on."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.13,
   "end": 47.58,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "That's your entire quality process, is it?"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.52,
   "end": 54.12,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Right, before this becomes a cake audit. Jamie Brennan and Callum Reid aren't with us today."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.5,
   "end": 61.5,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Jamie asked me to pass on that he's about halfway through recalibrating the sensors on the PRV on the boiler."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.45,
   "end": 63.65,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Yeah, cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.49,
   "end": 72.19,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "And Cal's near miss write-up at the palletiser needs to come across to you, Haley. Can you take that over from him?"
  },
  {
   "start": 74.57,
   "end": 77.37,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll take that write-up over from Cal."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.24,
   "end": 80.34,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Thanks. Pricey, how have yours gone?"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.84,
   "end": 89.89,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Um, the jam and sensor checks — I've got the first half done. Jam's cleared; I haven't got through the sensor checks yet."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.29,
   "end": 92.49,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Okay, thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.29,
   "end": 97.14,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "And my inspection for leaks is all done, all signed off."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.5,
   "end": 100.7,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Nice one."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.32,
   "end": 108.97,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "While we're on finished bits, I finished the repair on the GT2 Number 2 Bearing last night. That's sorted."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.0,
   "end": 115.2,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Ah, lovely. Bet you were pleased to see the back of that."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.5,
   "end": 118.65,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Yeah. Not my favourite evening, put it that way."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.57,
   "end": 128.97,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Only other thing from me, I noticed the big board was running a bit warm on nights, but it settled down. Just an observation."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.76,
   "end": 131.16,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Was that early on?"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.58,
   "end": 135.73,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yeah, early part of the shift. Nothing ongoing there."
  },
  {
   "start": 136.14,
   "end": 138.24,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Right. Two new bits this morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 140.68,
   "end": 149.08,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Haley, if you've got a spare minute, can you do a site visit at Kestrel Hydraulics Leeds with the contractor by end of day?"
  },
  {
   "start": 150.52,
   "end": 154.72,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "I can't take that, sorry. Can't get away from the plant today."
  },
  {
   "start": 156.55,
   "end": 160.4,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "No, fair enough. I wasn't sure whether you could get out."
  },
  {
   "start": 162.05,
   "end": 164.15,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Could you take that one, boss?"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.59,
   "end": 173.64,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll do the site visit at Kestrel Hydraulics Leeds with the contractor by end of day, if I've got a spare minute."
  },
  {
   "start": 174.54,
   "end": 176.64,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "A spare minute. Those mythical things."
  },
  {
   "start": 177.3,
   "end": 179.4,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Exactly. It's not a drop-everything one."
  },
  {
   "start": 180.25,
   "end": 182.7,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Sorry, you clipped there — drop everything?"
  },
  {
   "start": 184.4,
   "end": 187.55,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Not a drop-everything one. Definitely a 'not' in there."
  },
  {
   "start": 188.16,
   "end": 192.71,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Pricey, can you write up the near miss at the wrapper for Monday?"
  },
  {
   "start": 194.88,
   "end": 199.08,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll write up the near miss at the wrapper for Monday."
  },
  {
   "start": 201.01,
   "end": 203.81,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Sorry, I spoke over the end of that."
  },
  {
   "start": 204.46,
   "end": 206.21,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "You're all right, I'd finished."
  },
  {
   "start": 207.2,
   "end": 212.45,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Just checking I hadn't drowned you out again. This headset's either nothing or full tannoy."
  },
  {
   "start": 213.45,
   "end": 214.85,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Full tannoy's about right."
  },
  {
   "start": 216.75,
   "end": 218.85,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "We heard you both. Thanks, Pricey."
  },
  {
   "start": 220.25,
   "end": 221.45,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "No worries."
  },
  {
   "start": 221.81,
   "end": 224.26,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "That's everything I've got. Anything we've missed?"
  },
  {
   "start": 225.23,
   "end": 226.63,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Nothing else from me."
  },
  {
   "start": 228.84,
   "end": 230.24,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "No, all good here."
  },
  {
   "start": 231.64,
   "end": 234.79,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Only that I'm feeling personally attacked over the cakes."
  },
  {
   "start": 236.17,
   "end": 239.67,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Nobody actually said you were buying them. Interesting confession, though."
  },
  {
   "start": 240.16,
   "end": 241.56,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Right, I'm saying nothing."
  },
  {
   "start": 243.8,
   "end": 245.2,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Probably safest. Cheers, everyone."
  }
 ],
